","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103857},{"id":1788479768201,"text":"然后和女主又起了争执。","sender":"me","time":"08:53","timestamp":1788396787179,"replyTo":null,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103858},{"id":1788479768202,"text":"男主气的。","sender":"me","time":"08:53","timestamp":1788396790572,"replyTo":null,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103859},{"id":1788479768203,"text":"给女主灌了八碗孟婆汤。","sender":"me","time":"08:53","timestamp":1788396794964,"replyTo":null,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103860},{"id":1788479768204,"text":"所以第二世","sender":"me","time":"08:53","timestamp":1788396802113,"replyTo":null,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103861},{"id":1788479768205,"text":"男主没喝孟婆汤。","sender":"me","time":"08:53","timestamp":1788396805097,"replyTo":null,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103862},{"id":1788479768206,"text":"但是女主由于喝得太多，变成了傻子","sender":"me","time":"08:53","timestamp":1788396811409,"replyTo":null,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103863},{"id":1788479768208,"sender":"them","text":"八碗","timestamp":1788396822978,"tempo":"R","rawContent":"八碗","roundId":"round_1788396813130_duvs4x0tz","hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103864},{"id":1788479768209,"sender":"them","text":"孟婆那是按桶批发的吗","timestamp":1788396823447,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"孟婆那是按桶批发的吗","roundId":"round_1788396813130_duvs4x0tz","hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-96